:: TrustWidget [widget] {"position":"440,50","size":"100,100"}
<<widget "trust">>
  /* Usage: <<trust "Castella" 10>> */
  <<set $trust[_args[0]] to Math.clamp($trust[_args[0]] + _args[1], 0, 100)>>
  @@.trust;(_args[0] trust <<if _args[1] gte 0>>+<</if>>_args[1])@@
<</widget>>
<<widget "meet">>
  /* Usage: <<meet "Castella">> shows the name, codex link and current trust */
  @@.who;''_args[0]''@@ <span class="trustval">(trust: <<print $trust[_args[0]] ?? "n/a">>)</span>
<</widget>>


:: Start {"position":"50,170","size":"100,100"}
<img class="art" src="img/title-bg.jpg" alt="Project Atlantis title art">
!Atlantis: District Simulation (scaffold)

Atlantis is sealing itself off district by district as the Bleaching spreads. The Oceanography Council has sent you down to find their missing contact, Sir Richard Black.

This file is scaffolding. Each act has a hub, each hub links to its locations, and each location links to the characters who appear there. Passages tagged `todo` need writing.

[[Begin Act 1|Act 1]]
[[Character Codex|Codex]]
[[Districts Map|Districts]]


:: Districts [map todo] {"position":"180,170","size":"100,100"}
!Districts

* ''District 1'': the palace and the scientists. King Lareas, Serena Waves, the virologist.
* ''District 2'': Aishui's approach. (Ranhuma's bio also places him here.)
* ''District 3'': the Golden Oyster, Pearl's store, the slums (Gumboh, Eelis, Sabelle).
* ''District 4'': mid-level district; the brothers' workshop.
* ''District 5'': the desert; Skuttle's bunker, Silik, the Wellness Retreat, the final confrontation.
* ''The Hook'': the cave where the leviathan is first seen.
* ''The Wilds'': outside the bulwarks; research station, Sabelle's Power Washer.

TODO: confirm district numbering. Several bios use "slums", "mid-level" and "wealthy region" instead of numbers.

<<return>>


